  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In case, nitrogen and sulphur both are present in an organic compound, sodium thiocyanate is formed. It gives blood red colour and no Prussian blue since there are no free cyanide ions.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>NaSCN</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>SCN</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><mfenced><mi>SCN</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Blood</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>red</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>NaCNS</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>NaCN</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
